\newsection{Overview}

The following are an assortment of questions that range from \textbf{Beginner} to \textbf{Advanced}.

The questions are not ordered in their respective categories, some may be harder than others and appear sooner or they may be easier and appear later. Beyond the given examples, they are left without specific test cases.

If you find a question doesn't look/sound right, you want clarification on something, or if you just want to talk about computer science feel free to message us on the \href{https://discord.gg/gGbqfrSeMD}{CCCS High-school Programming Challenge Discord}.

Over the coming months before the programming contest \emph{(March 4th)} we will be posting solutions and walkthroughs for some of the questions found in the document as well.

Good luck and have fun!

